							description:
								'Site permalink structure. If present and different from the current permalink structure, the Blueprint runner will run `$wp_rewrite->flush_rules();`. If you only want to set this option without flushing the rules, use an explicit `additionalStepsAfterExecution` step.\n\nExample: "/%year%/%monthnum%/%postname%/" or false for no pretty permalinks.',
