								'Human-readable name of the theme for the progress bar.\n\nFor example, with the following Blueprint:\n\n```json {     "themes": [         {             "source": "https://github.com/Automattic/adventurer/archive/refs/heads/beta.zip",             "humanReadableName": "Adventurer"         }     ] } ```\n\nThe progress bar will show "Installing Adventurer theme" instead of "Installing https://github.com/Automattic/adventurer/archive/refs/heads/beta.zip".',
