								description:
									'An array of labels for this post type. If not set, post labels are inherited for non-hierarchical types and page labels for hierarchical ones\n\nThe labels documented for WordPress 6.8 are listed below, and this type also supports an arbitrary set of labels to support future WordPress releases.',
